{"seq":37,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28400"},"reason":"New question added to grow the article from five to six facts: According to the biblical account of creation, what did God create on the second day of creation? (answer: the firmament), verified against the cited sources.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firmament"},{"url":"https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Genesis+1%3A6-8&version=NRSVUE"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"the firmament"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"die Feste"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"твердь"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[591,13],"de":[630,9],"ru":[545,6]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"-600","end":null,"precision":"century","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"The Priestly creation account of Genesis 1 is composed (c. 6th century BC)","labelDe":"Der priesterschriftliche Schöpfungsbericht in Genesis 1 entsteht (um das 6. Jahrhundert v. Chr.)","labelRu":"Составлен жреческий рассказ о сотворении мира в Бытии 1 (около VI века до н. э.)"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firmament","title":"Firmament – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"607edf80d33e"},
